title: Start
---
<<declare $giveTheScrewdriver = false>>
Narrator: You are an astronaut crashed on Mars. 
Narrator: With your crew you managed to survive and build a station on Mars where you can live for a while. 
Narrator: You and your crew can't wait to leave this damn planet.
Narrator: You hope that this is the day that you will leave this place.
Narrator: Now go to request a status report from the orange crewmate.
// <<give_item "Player" "Screwdriver1">>
// <<give_item "Player" "CircuitBoard1">>

===

title: OrangeCrewmate
---
<<if $giveTheScrewdriver == false && not has_item("Player","Screwdriver_item")>>
You: Status report.

Orange Crewmate: Yes, captain!


Orange Crewmate: There is a huge sandstorm outside of our station.

Orange Crewmate: The rocket is 99,9% done.
// <<set_enabled_in_unity "OrangeGuyTalking" true>>
// <<set_enabled_in_unity "OrangeGuyTalking" false>>
Orange Crewmate: If we don't leave now there is a huge possibility that our rocket will fall down and extend our stay with about 4-5 months.

Orange Crewmate: All we need is to fix this circuit board on my desk and we are ready.

Orange Crewmate: There is a problem. I left my screwdriver near the rocket launchpad. 

You: Don't worry. I will go there and take your tool.
Orange Crewmate: But please be carefull. Mind your oxygen.

<<elseif has_item("Player","Screwdriver_item") && $giveTheScrewdriver == false>>
<<set $giveTheScrewdriver = true>>
<<take_item "Player" "Screwdriver_item">>
Orange Crewmate: Great! Thanks.

Orange Crewmate: Oh no. My bad. This is the wrong type of screwdriver.

Orange Crewmate: I left the other one in the toolbox in the other station. You know the one that is located directly straight from the door.

You: Ok. I will get it. 
Orange Crewmate: Hey also one small reminder. There is an O2 tank in the other station. Could be usefull.

<<elseif has_item("Player", "Toolbox1")>>
<<take_item "Player" "Toolbox1">>
Orange Crewmate: Thanks. But there is other problem now. 

Orange Crewmate: I can't fix the circuit board. I need new one.

Orange Crewmate: Luckily for us there is one functoning circuit board on the nose of the old crashed rocket located left of the hatch.

Orange Crewmate: Use this screwdriver to get it.

<<give_item "Player" "Screwdriver_item">>
You: Ok. Let's hope this is the last task.
<<elseif has_item("Player", "CircuitBoard1")>>
Orange Crewmate: Finally!!! 

Orange Crewmate: That's it.

Orange Crewmate: We can leave now!!!

<<set_enabled_in_unity "WinScreen" true>>
//<<disable_controls "Player">>
<<endif>>
===

title: Toolbox
---
<<wait 0.1>>
<<set_enabled_in_unity "Toolbox" false>>
===

title: CircuitBoard
---
<<wait 0.1>>
<<set_enabled_in_unity "CircuitBoard" false>>
===

title: Screwdriver
---
<<wait 0.1>>
<<set_enabled_in_unity "Screwdriver" false>>
===

title: OxygenTank
---

Tip: Press R to fill half of your oxygen tank.(use in emergency)
<<wait 0.1>>
<<set_enabled_in_unity "OxygenTank" false>>
===